From 162126892e7911345b0e75156cccd512baa84a83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris" <dileepapeiris5@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:56:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Changeset for the iOS attendee properties

---
 .changeset/expo-calendar-ios-attendee-properties.md | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .changeset/expo-calendar-ios-attendee-properties.md

diff --git a/.changeset/expo-calendar-ios-attendee-properties.md b/.changeset/expo-calendar-ios-attendee-properties.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..52ed930079b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/expo-calendar-ios-attendee-properties.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'expo-calendar': patch
+---
+
+[iOS] Expose `name`, `role`, `status`, `type`, `url` and `isCurrentUser` on the attendee objects that `ExpoCalendarEvent.getAttendees()` returns. The class was registered without properties, so every field read as `undefined`.
